  partName: Fuel Injector
  description: The Fuel Injector is a tiny, elongated component positioned at the
    top-center-front of the engine, tasked with spraying fuel into the intake manifold
    at high pressure. Constructed from Material.002, this part is crucial for maintaining
    the optimal air-fuel mixture, and its tiny size belies its significant impact
    on engine performance. Notably, the fuel injector's elongated shape enables it
    to precisely target the fuel spray pattern.
